      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree c08ce547e5c7d8a87b2a0ab82a33a60378c5a49a\nparent f8e5906015a0681dc60d07fa57cb42acc100d9f6\nauthor Hennadii Stepanov <32963518+hebasto@users.noreply.github.com> 1792156136 +0900\ncommitter Hennadii Stepanov <32963518+hebasto@users.noreply.github.com> 1792156136 +0900\n\ncmake, crypto: Use `-msse4.1` instead of `-msse4` for x86 SHA-NI\n\n`-msse4` is merely a synonym for `-msse4.2` in both GCC and Clang, but\nit is not accepted by the clang-cl frontend. Furthermore, the x86\nSHA-NI code uses only SSE4.1 intrinsics and no SSE4.2 ones.\n\nReplace `-msse4` with `-msse4.1` to resolve both issues.\n\nThe absence of SSE4.2 usage can be verified by building with\n`-DAPPEND_CXXFLAGS=-mno-sse4.2`.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEE0dvyxLlvLev0wWZUQQEIES5+qB8FAmrSIegACgkQQQEIES5+\nqB8qNhAAuGjfCmp7+MwIO8MRo4Y1PhZkbmH9w9r/4wTpUkjqSmhCCCHVr1zxoNG+\nB9NS8IFqW8HWBvAi++BZzsT2ZtCbe9maabXl7KgW2wbwicsDiJ2DPPkj75db654l\nRQHMGaXCwph35eRxJob47iwGFRo2qwQyRpgxOppGXKTf/8YSkQ3H8OgpjkTeib0f\ngcw5zEOt6+r+KnzufRn5Dfi1VFKlaAn9+dn2OtFjvhtCbTV10qGKkv7sd08hqOUJ\n/wqMeCeEBZDGodpefeqRbXUWVYpec20v+GZYZCQkYH+jHGCB+Gg57Pp9RnJb67TM\nIh0LfFchpFJ4UYAn8TIsXklczJBpDQ6oDhjUz/oOCBH6c+5MHmkH2QYLYZH5efK4\n5mNGqOcyg2tkHGOVYPf2zLY5t9vjXtLVqptUN+6vrg+gCj5MgeobkT9oMSd768FI\n0+WmcfTTxJ4hlgNmFXIzqWtAWnk1QxJ6nION4BFwkpBpS83+MDrS1O3gvh/7s5cw\nEAkzUu7DWncsTy568qzHCunmVxqYYUIMQYphpHshhlWr2Ecwn0bPqJRQd3rAGU3F\n4G9A9/TnMl9gRLW9BVhopIj/Riwrf5EzXUJuju1AFCFrsotIHwv/fK08aqmyY+2B\nAKXDv4xki7xuroXYUqrxfEt6Cgzst9yO2Lm9LMZ5i6/Uso98SqM=\n=qMQQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
